                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَلَآءٌ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>Relationship:</i> so in the phrase <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَيْنَهُمَا وَلَآءٌ</span>
[<i>Between them two is relationship</i>]. (JM.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
