<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَيْرٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَلَآءٌ</span> The <i>right to the inheritance of the
